🔥 Scenario shorts (see also scenario file)

- Duplicate processing → idempotent consumer (event/txn id)
- Kafka unavailable → don’t fake success; outbox + retries; consumers resume from offsets; alert brokers/ISR
- Consumer failure → rebalance + committed offsets; poison → retry → DLT
- Ordering → same key → same partition
- High volume → more partitions/consumers/brokers; batching; avoid huge payloads
- Prod failures → retries, DLT, idempotency, lag alerts, replay runbooks
